# Outputs: only NDA video-derived parquets are excluded.
# SoccerNet confirmed (2026-06-01): the GSR annotations are open source; content
# derived from the video carries the video's copyright. Raw detections (pixel
# bboxes / HSV), ball positions, and TVCalib homographies are all fit to NDA
# frames, so they stay private and ship only in the closed university submission.
# Annotation-derived and aggregate-statistic parquets (PC surfaces, validation,
# ICC, benchmarks, StatsBomb set-pieces) ARE committed so the public analysis
# and CI are self-contained.
outputs/detections_soccana_tvcalib.parquet
outputs/ball_positions.parquet
outputs/homographies_tvcalib.parquet
# Exploratory diagnostic scatters (regenerated on demand; not thesis artifacts).
outputs/figures/diagnostics/
# SoccerNet-derived demo media (rendered from NDA video frames).
outputs/figures/annotated/
outputs/figures/overlay/
outputs/figures/*.mp4
outputs/figures/*.gif
outputs/figures/still_*.png
report.pdf
report.docx
